  <div class="content">
    <h2>Funding Opportunities</h2>
<div class="holder blue">
<div id="pane-blue" class="scroll-pane">
<div class="view-content">



<p><a href="https://files.simpler.grants.gov/opportunities/e60227f3-787d-418c-aadf-f6e36a9f9890/attachments/c9dccab2-23c5-4b61-80e9-1037c273e244/RFA-RM-27-002-Full-Announcement.html" target="_blank">NIH Director's New Innovator Award (DP2 Clinical Trial Optional)</a><br />Application due date: August 17, 2026</p>

<p><a href="https://files.simpler.grants.gov/opportunities/a71fb2f3-0d3a-477b-8b20-2451cf35cc7f/attachments/8ccde07e-c051-4507-9290-1f7bdf20b555/RFA-RM-27-003-Full-Announcement.html" target="_blank">NIH Director's Transformative Research Award for Individual and Group Science (R01 Clinical Trial Optional)</a><br />Application due date: September 3, 2026</p>


<p><a href="https://files.simpler.grants.gov/opportunities/f3b0799c-6539-4045-8b85-42d7a9ef4dd5/attachments/ed6ead5d-829a-4e73-8c7a-e657936a9dc1/RFA-RM-27-001-Full-Announcement.html" target="_blank">NIH Director's Pioneer Award (DP1 Clinical Trial Optional)</a><br />Application due date: September 9, 2026</p>

<p><a href="https://files.simpler.grants.gov/opportunities/8518b002-2452-44e3-8b00-78fcaa5c7edb/attachments/7ad160c4-0399-4f47-adff-189bd6b25542/RFA-RM-27-004-Full-Announcement.html" target="_blank">NIH Director's Early Independence Award (DP5 Clinical Trial Optional)</a><br />Application due date: September 10, 2026</p>

<p><a href="https://www.pcori.org/funding-opportunities/announcement/addressing-substance-use-pcori-funding-announcement-cycle-3-2026" target="_blank">PCORI: Addressing Substance Use</a><br />Town Hall: August 18, 2026, 12 pm-1 pm
Letter of intent due date: September 9, 2026, 5:00 pm<br />Letter of intent status notification: October 14, 2026<br />Application due date: January 12, 2027, 5:00 pm</p>

